    @template format_dari/hero_source
    @copyright  2026 Dari Learning
    @license    http://www.gnu.org/copyleft/gpl.html GNU GPL v3 or later

    The rendered course banner, parked in an inert template element until the
    format_dari/heroinject module moves it into place on pages core renders.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * html string The banner, already rendered by format_dari/hero or format_dari/activity_hero.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "html": "<section class=\"format-dari-hero\"></section>"
    }
}}
<template id="dari-hero-source">{{{html}}}</template>
